# Cloudflare Pages — Git-connected build settings
# Dashboard → Workers & Pages → your project → Settings → Builds
#
# Framework preset:        None
# Root directory:          /
# Build command:           npm run build
# Build output directory:  frontend/out
# Deploy command:          npm run deploy:cloudflare
# Version command:         npm run version:cloudflare
# Node.js version:         22  (set NODE_VERSION=22 in dashboard environment variables)
#
# Deploy runs Wrangler from frontend/ (see frontend/wrangler.toml) to avoid
# monorepo workspace detection errors at the repository root.
#
# Environment variables (Production):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://doxastudios.ca
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=xxxxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDLY_URL=https://calendly.com/your-account/30min
